List your objects with status and progress. One line per object.
Use get_object(object_id) for full details.

exec tool declaration:
```ts
declare const tools: { mcp__pixellab__list_objects(args: {
  limit?: number;
  offset?: number;
  // Filter by name, case-insensitive. Matches the name shown here and the description it was created from, so 'chest' finds 'treasure chest'.
  search?: string | null;
  // Filter by status: completed, review, pending, processing, failed.
  status_filter?: string | null;
  // Comma-separated tags to filter by (matches ANY tag).
  tags?: string | null;
}): Promise<CallToolResult>; };
```
